title: BallThrow
---
NPC: Howdy!! How can I help you?
-> How do I play this game?
    NPC: You put in a coin and some balls will appear.
    NPC: Next you will have to click to grab the ball.
    NPC: Then you will have to hold click and release to throw the ball.
    NPC: You can see the amount of power you have charged up on the side of your screen!
    NPC: Have fun!!!!
-> Fuck off you creepy clown!!
    NPC: Rude. ;-;
===

